text:
if you’re laughing at this while going unmasked during an ongoing mass-disabling event:

you should look up how hard it is for many people with ME/CFS (which has huge overlaps with #LongCovid) to keep up with personal hygiene.

you would too if a shower wiped you out for days, or a week.

